{"id":"fear-of-the-lord","title":"Fear of the Lord","kind":"phrase","en":["fear of the Lord","fear of God"],"la":["timor Domini","timor Dei"],"gist":"In Scripture this is not terror but reverent awe before God, which leads to love and obedience. Proverbs calls it the beginning of wisdom, and Isaiah lists it among the gifts of the Spirit. The Church names it one of the seven gifts of the Holy Spirit.","original":"Hebrew yir'at YHWH.","passages":[{"ref":"Proverbs 1:7","note":"'The fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom.'"},{"ref":"Isaiah 11:2-3","note":"A gift of the Spirit."},{"ref":"Psalm 111:10","note":"'The fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom.'"},{"ref":"Acts 9:31","note":"The Church walked 'in the fear of the Lord'."}],"related":[],"total":76,"byBook":{"1SA":1,"2CH":4,"2CO":2,"2SA":1,"ACT":1,"GEN":1,"ISA":5,"JDT":1,"JOB":2,"JOS":1,"NEH":1,"PRO":15,"PSA":5,"ROM":1,"SIR":30,"TOB":5},"verses":["1SA.11.7","2CH.17.10","2CH.19.7","2CH.19.9","2CH.20.29","2CO.5.11","2CO.7.1","2SA.23.3","ACT.9.31","GEN.20.11","ISA.2.10","ISA.2.19","ISA.2.21","ISA.11.3","ISA.33.6","JDT.8.24","JOB.6.14","JOB.28.28","JOS.22.25","NEH.5.15","PRO.1.7","PRO.1.29","PRO.2.5","PRO.8.13","PRO.9.10","PRO.10.27","PRO.14.26","PRO.14.27","PRO.15.16","PRO.15.27","PRO.15.33","PRO.16.6","PRO.19.23","PRO.22.4","PRO.23.17","PSA.13.3","PSA.18.10","PSA.33.12","PSA.35.2","PSA.110.10","ROM.3.18","SIR.1.11","SIR.1.12","SIR.1.16","SIR.1.17","SIR.1.22","SIR.1.27","SIR.1.34","SIR.1.36","SIR.7.21","SIR.9.22","SIR.10.25","SIR.16.1","SIR.19.18","SIR.19.21","SIR.21.13","SIR.23.27","SIR.23.31","SIR.23.37","SIR.25.8","SIR.25.14","SIR.25.15","SIR.25.16","SIR.27.4","SIR.28.8","SIR.37.15","SIR.40.26","SIR.40.27","SIR.40.28","SIR.45.28","SIR.49.6","TOB.2.14","TOB.6.22","TOB.9.12","TOB.14.4","TOB.14.16"]}